F. COMPTIME VM
  Stack-based. Values: Integer(i128), Float(f128), Bool, String, Type,
  Descriptor, Expr, Stmt, Pointer, Void.
  Limits: 10^8 instructions, 2GB heap, 1024 recursion, 1MB strings, 10^6 arrays.

G. FAT POINTER ABI
  &Trait = { data: *void, vtable: *void }  (16 bytes on 64-bit)
  VTable = { type_id, drop_fn, method_0..method_N }

H. DEFER / ERRDEFER
  defer <expr>;      → executes on BLOCK exit, LIFO.
  errdefer { block } → executes on FUNCTION error exit, LIFO, before propagate.

I. MODULES
  module name matches file path (dots = separators).
  import resolution: builtin → project (dots→/ + .ray) → external (future).
  Private by default. pub exports. Circular imports = error.

J. ERRORS
  !T tag: 0x00000000 = success. 0x0001-0xFFFF = reserved runtime.
  0x00010000-0xFFFFFFFF = (module_id:u16 << 16) | error_code:u16.

K. SAFETY
  Guaranteed: bounds check, null check, overflow check (debug), type safety.
  NOT guaranteed: lifetimes, dangling ptrs, data races, use-after-free.
  UB (debug=panic, release=UB): OOB, null deref, signed overflow, undef read.
  Always UB: dangling raw ptr derefs, data races, FFI contract violation.

